'''Buffy''' is the name of the AI agent you talk to inside '''[[Freebuff]]'''. When someone says "ask Buffy", they mean the AI in the chat window. The name also appears in Freebuff's own branding and merchandise — the store sells a [https://freebuff.com/store/buffy-on-fire-t-shirt "Buffy on Fire" T-shirt].

''Everything is on this page — just scroll. Words in yellow are links.''

